//
// @file developer_test.rho
// @brief The unit tests of the Developer section: reading `rho req --tsv`, the names a request may carry, who is a maintainer, and the commit's branch and message.
//
// @module keeper.developer_test
// @project keeper
// @author Aurel Miron
// @date 2026-11-19
